{"schemaVersion":1,"seq":9,"prev":"8b2723d6c4e8afe2a690f91b36801fbcb110cd8f13d406fe2ff88eb9da667a67","at":"2026-09-28T04:06:21.420216Z","type":"llm_call","state":"adjudicate","iter":0,"node":"adjudicate","data":{"kind":"adjudicate","model":"codex/gpt-5.6-sol","effort":"medium","index":0,"input_hash":"2f1387dc54438ec9f60e7c5695d1241e5867e5e4d59c5683e9abc37f04cc67f0","verdict":{"reasoning":"The code does write the size stamp when `conflicts` is non-empty, but the claimed failure requires a later deletion or rewrite of the common ledger, which is not shown as a supported operation. At migration time the run ID already has a terminal row in the common ledger, and the mismatch is explicitly returned in `conflicts`, so it is not silent. The special retry behavior is documented only for collided runs deferred by `MigrateLegacyRuns`; this finding does not establish that ordinary row conflicts are expected to become resolvable without the legacy file changing.","is_real":false,"confidence":0.9},"confidence":0.9,"tokens":{"input":12713,"cache_read":10752,"cache_create":0,"output":134,"reasoning":263},"duration_ms":25351}}
{"schemaVersion":1,"seq":10,"prev":"e0e81529cdb1f087c49ddf2b08159c9bc0c42bbee9091b4fd3ef24c4f731a7f1","at":"2026-09-28T04:06:32.943192Z","type":"llm_call","state":"adjudicate","iter":0,"node":"adjudicate","data":{"kind":"adjudicate","model":"codex/gpt-5.6-sol","effort":"medium","index":1,"input_hash":"109dac9791bb88f73f9551713e1193c7c04add2a3d74af153a3d7baeebaef79d","verdict":{"reasoning":"The finding is grounded in the new helper: syscall.Access(path, X_OK) succeeds for an executable regular file, but enterableAncestor returns that path without verifying it is a directory. repo.StoreDir and repo.Toplevel then cannot operate from it, causing mine to fall back to `here == main`. Consequently, a run originating in a linked worktree can be excluded there and incorrectly attributed to the main checkout if its recorded work directory is replaced by an executable file.","is_real":true,"confidence":0.98},"confidence":0.98,"tokens":{"input":23425,"cache_read":0,"cache_create":0,"output":115,"reasoning":145},"duration_ms":11507}}
